# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> (temporally qualified continuant)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> "temporally qualified continuant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068> "A temporally qualified continuant is a continuant that, by reference to a determinate temporal region, is such as to possess its properties only for so long as that period obtains, being otherwise in its essentiality unchanged."@en)
