AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000597> "fundamental property of matter representing the mass of a portion of matter per unit volume"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000597> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> (device)

