AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> "device"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> "A device is an object that is designed to perform a specific function or task involving measurement, manipulation, processing, or analysis."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> "Ein physisches oder virtuelles Objekt, das verwendet wird, um eine bestimmte Funktion oder Aufgabe auszuführen, häufig im Zusammenhang mit der Messung, Manipulation oder Analyse von Materialien."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> obo:BFO_0000030)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000619> (electric potential)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000619> "electric potential"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000619> "an extensvie quality describing the amount of work needed to move a unit charge from a reference point to a specific location in an electric field."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000619> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080116>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000619> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000654> (functional material)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000654> "functional material"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000654> "A functional material F is a material which has the function to be used for an object O (O consists of F) and O's function is other/more than mechanical load carrying."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000654> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000085 obo:BFO_0000034)))))
