# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000888> (polymer)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000888> "polymer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000888> "A polymer is a material that consists of many repeated subunits (monomers) to form long chains. The atoms within a polymer chain are bonded together by covalent bonds. The intermolecular forces between polymer chains are typically represented by van der waals forces and hydrogen bonds."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000888> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002353 <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010033>)))
