# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> (temperature)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Temperatur"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "temperature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "Die Temperatur ist eine grundlegende intensive Qualität, die die durchschnittliche atomare oder molekulare Bewegung oder Schwingung eines Teils der Materie darstellt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> "The temperature is a fundamental intensive quality representing the average atomic or molcular movement or vibration of a portion of matter."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> (organische Zusammensetzung)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> "organic composition"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> "organische Zusammensetzung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> "A composition characterized by a primary molecular structure of carbon atoms covalently bonded to hydrogen (C-H bonds), typically forming linear, branched, or networked chains."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010026> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010033> (polymerization)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010033> "polymerization"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010033> "The chemical process of reacting monomers, oligomers, or reactive precursors together to form longer macromolecular chains or three-dimensional networks"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010033> obo:BFO_0000015)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> (proportion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> "Anteil"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> "proportion"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> "A proportion is a relational quality between two entities (the whole and the part) which quantifies the relation between the whole and its part."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002328 obo:BFO_0000001))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> (mass ratio)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Massenverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "mass ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Das Massenverhältnis bezeichnet eine relationale Qualität, die einen Massenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt und typischerweise eine dimensionslose Zahl ergibt"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Mass ratio denotes a relational quality expressing one mass value relative to another, typically producing a dimensionless number"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> (Molverhältnis)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Molverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "molar ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Der Molanteil ist der Anteil, der die Anzahl der Einheiten des Teils im Verhältnis zur Anzahl der Einheiten des Ganzen quantifiziert."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Molar proportion is the proportion which quantifies the entities count of the part in relation to the entities count of the whole."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> (volume ratio)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volumenverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "volume ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volume ratio represents a relational quality expressing one volume value relative to another, typically resulting in a dimensionless number"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volumenverhältnis stellt eine relationale Qualität dar, die einen Volumenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt, typischerweise resultierend in einer dimensionslosen Zahl"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> (fluid (object))

