AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> "Fluid (object) is an object that consists of some portion of matter which bears an aggregate state that concretizes a liquid or gaseous aggregate state."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:BFO_0000030 ObjectUnionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290>)))
