AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> "elektrische Ladung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> "Electric charge refers to the physical property of matter causing it to experience a force when placed in an electromagnetic field"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> obo:BFO_0000019)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020312> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000080 ObjectUnionOf(obo:BFO_0000027 obo:BFO_0000030))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069> (physisch relative Qualität)

